{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:54:10+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:54:10+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Palfinger AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","country":"Austria","city":"Bergheim","website":"https://www.palfinger.ag","employees":11773,"summary":"Palfinger AG, together with its subsidiaries, provides hydraulic lifting solutions in Austria and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Sales and Service, and Operations. It offers loader, timber and recycling, marine, offshore, wind, and mobile cranes, as well as hooklifts and skiploaders, tail and passenger lifts, aerial work platforms, truck-mounted forklifts, boats, rope access, winches and offshore equipment, and railway, davit, and slip systems. The company also provides loading and transport logistics services, as well as digital solutions. It serves various industries, including transport and logistics, rental and leasing, agriculture and forestry, waste management, railroads, government organization, infrastructure and construction, energy supply, telecommunications, mining, offshore, passenger and cruise, marine and coast guard, aquaculture and fisheries, and trade. The company was founded in 1932 and is headquartered in Bergheim, Austria. Palfinger AG operates as a subsidiary of The Palfinger Family.","exchange":"Vienna","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Palfinger AG, avec ses filiales, fournit des solutions de levage hydraulique en Autriche et à l'international. La société opère dans deux secteurs, les ventes et le service, et les opérations. Il propose des grues de chargement, de bois et de recyclage, marines, offshore, éoliennes et mobiles, ainsi que des élévateurs à crochet et à benne, des élévateurs à queue et à passagers, des plates-formes de travail aériennes, des chariots élévateurs montés sur camion, des bateaux, des accès par corde, des treuils et des équipements offshore, et des systèmes ferroviaires, de bossoir et de glissement."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1052611200,"shares_outstanding":37593258,"trailing_pe":11.067194,"forward_pe":9.745266,"price_to_book":1.3867564,"ev_to_ebitda":7.476,"ev_to_revenue":0.691,"dividend_yield":0.0325,"payout_ratio":0.3557,"beta_yahoo":null},"targets":{"current_price":28.0,"mean":41.25,"median":40.5,"high":56.0,"low":33.0,"n_analysts":6,"reco_mean":1.33333,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-28"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-10","dividend_date":"1970-08-23"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.56200004,"institutions_pct":0.18794,"institutions_float_pct":0.42908,"institutions_n":103,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0058999998,"shares":221007,"value":6188196,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0955},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0043,"shares":163294,"value":4572232,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.1744},{"name":"iShares, Inc.-iShares MSCI Austria ETF","pct":0.0029,"shares":110149,"value":3084172,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.1868},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT TRUST CO-The Continental Small Company Series","pct":0.0021,"shares":77895,"value":2181060,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD Intl Eqy. INDEX Fd.S-Vanguard FTSE All-World ex-US Small-Cap ","pct":0.0017,"shares":62857,"value":1759996,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.1358},{"name":"WisdomTree Trust-WisdomTree Europe Hedged Equity Fund","pct":0.0017,"shares":64330,"value":1801240,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":-0.0172},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares MSCI EAFE Small-Cap ETF","pct":0.0016,"shares":59222,"value":1658216,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":-0.0041},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-Intl Core Eqy. 2 PORT.","pct":0.0011,"shares":41987,"value":1175636,"date":"2026-0